    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d708">

                <pb facs="1014" n="1522" sameAs="frus:frus1948v05p2/pg1522"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">501.BB Palestine/10–2648: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State
                        to the United States Delegation at Paris</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">secret   us urgent</hi>
                        <lb/>
                        
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">niact</hi>
                        
                    </seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1948-10-27T17:00:00-05:00">October 27, 1948—5
                            p. m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    Gadel 330. Assumption set forth third para.
                        Delga 488, Oct. 26, is correct. Under
                    authority Gadel 266, Oct. 21 you should limit
                    your action to speaking very briefly in support of and voting for resolution
                    whose text was transmitted as Delga
                        489.<anchor n="1" xml:id="d708-f1"/> We suggest that last para. this draft
                    resolution might more appropriately repeat language of resolution July 15, which
                    referred to “further action under Chapter VII” rather than specific reference to
                    Art. 41.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Lovett</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
